#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:161
msgid ""
"Remove :func:`sensor.set_framerate` calls (:ref:`the set_framerate removal "
"<v3_6_1_setframerate>`)."
msgstr ""
"Verwijder :func:`sensor.set_framerate` aanroepen (\\ :ref:`de verwijdering "
"van set_framerate <v3_6_1_setframerate>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.1.rst:163
msgid ""
"Move TensorFlow workloads off the OpenMV Cam M7 (:ref:`the M7 TensorFlow "
"change <v3_6_1_tfm7>`)."
msgstr ""
"Verplaats TensorFlow-werklasten weg van de OpenMV Cam M7 (\\ :ref:`de M7 "
